        "page": 1,
        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p1_s1"
      },
      "text": "In August 2019, FireEye released the “Double Dragon” report on our newest graduated threat group, APT41.",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
      "source": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev_2",
      "evidence_type": "report_text",
      "report_id": "Fireeye_GAMEOVER-Detecting-Stopping-APT41-Operation(08-19-2019)",
      "locator": {
        "page": 1,
        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p1_s2"
      },
      "text": "A China-nexus dual espionage and financially-focused group, APT41 targets industries such as gaming, healthcare, high-tech, higher education, telecommunications, and travel services.",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
      "source": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev_5",
      "evidence_type": "report_text",
      "report_id": "Fireeye_GAMEOVER-Detecting-Stopping-APT41-Operation(08-19-2019)",
      "locator": {
        "page": 1,
        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p1_s5"
      },
      "text": "Our knowledge of this group’s targets and activities are rooted in our Incident Response and Managed Defense services, where we encounter actors like APT41 on a regular basis.",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
      "source": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev_14",
      "evidence_type": "report_text",
