      "locator": {
        "page": 4,
        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p4_s7"
      },
      "text": "(An exploration of passive backdoors and more analysis of the HIGHNOON malware family can be found in our full APT41 report).",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
      "source": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev_19",
      "evidence_type": "report_text",
      "report_id": "Fireeye_GAMEOVER-Detecting-Stopping-APT41-Operation(08-19-2019)",
      "locator": {
        "page": 4,
        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p4_s8"
      },
      "text": "Within the next 35 minutes, the attackers utilized both the test.jsp web shell and the HIGHNOON backdoor to issue commands to the system.",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
      "source": "document"
    },
    {
